<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float">Listing 1: </span>JEPA-SCORE implementation in PyTorch. Our empirical ablations demonstrate that JEPA-SCORE is not sensitive to the choice of eps (we pick <math id="LST1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1e-6" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1e-6</annotation></semantics></math>)</figcaption>
</figure>
